# 09 Results: RCM error measured with the NDI tracker

Generated by `analysis.py`. RCM error = distance from the tracked shaft line to the RCM point latched at the start, over the longest RCM segment, recomputed from `NDI_PATH.csv` (matches the recorder's own column: max |difference| 0.0000 mm over 69 runs).

**Excluded (found by the camera check: persistent step > 3 mm between 4 s medians of the FK-vs-NDI residual):**

- `V8/CalibratedKinematics/FastCheckingRCMSimpleHolder_Replay1`: camera/wand moved: FK-vs-NDI residual stepped 6.9 mm during the run (RCM rms 5.08 mm)

